# Local speed-up cache for `npm run compile`'s incremental default (see
# _cpl/modules/incremental.js) — safe to delete any time, and never meaningful
# to commit: CI and the pre-push hook always compile with --full instead of
# trusting it, and a stale checked-in copy would only mislead the next person's
# machine.
_cpl/.compile-cache.json
